Design Config so that it can be reloaded at runtime when the dashboard restart action is invoked, ensuring that changes in watch-config.txt are picked up without requiring a process restart. Align file path resolution with the documented PVSS_II.log location in Desigo CC projects, where logs live under the project log directory, and integrate knowledge of PVSS_II.log as the default scan file used by the Trace Viewer.
